[ti:Master, the Tempest Is Raging]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]Master, the tempest is raging
[00:25.20]The billows are tossing high
[00:45.20]The sky is o'ershadowed with blackness
[01:07.20]No shelter or help is nigh
[01:29.20]Carest Thou not that we perish
[01:49.20]How canst Thou lie asleep
[02:18.20]The winds and the waves shall obey Thy will
[02:47.20]Peace, be still
